# dynatrace_ingest_enrichment_config (Resource)

-> This resource requires the API token scopes **Read settings** (`settings.read`) and **Write settings** (`settings.write`) or the OAuth scopes **Read settings** (`settings:objects:read`) and **Write settings** (`settings:objects:write`)

## Dynatrace Documentation

- Ingest enrichment - https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/manage/tags/tags-central-enrichment
- Settings API - https://www.dynatrace.com/support/help/dynatrace-api/environment-api/settings (schemaId: `builtin:ingest.enrichment.config`)

## Export Example Usage

- `terraform-provider-dynatrace -export dynatrace_ingest_enrichment_config` downloads all existing ingest enrichment configurations

The full documentation of the export feature is available [here](https://dt-url.net/h203qmc).

